    <td>{{ t('Hawkish hold, no published path; dot withheld; strict-2% loud. No cut at July & Sept (the master gate). Task forces seed "level-shift vs underlying" + "higher trend productivity" — the permission slips appearing BEFORE the cut.', '鹰派按兵、无公开路径；不交点位；高调严格2%。7月与9月不降息（总闸门）。工作组埋下"价位跳升 vs 潜在通胀"+"趋势生产率更高"的措辞 —— 降息前先出现的"许可证"。') }}</td>
